<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Warburg starts Latam banks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Warburg starts Latam banks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SBC Warburg analysts Catherine Gex and Clare Nickson said they initiated coverage of 11 Latin American banks.</p>
<p>-- They initiated Unibanco Group SA and Itaubanco with buy ratings;</p>
<p>-- initiated Banco Frances del Rio de la Plata SA and Credicorp Ltd with add ratings;  </p>
<p>-- initiated Banco de Galicia y Buenos Aires SA, Banco del Sud SA, Bradesco SA, Banacci, Banco Wiese Ltdo SA, Grupo Financiero Bancomer SA de CV and Grupo Financiero Serfin SA DE CV with hold.</p>
</text>
